The portraits in this directory (tara-portrait.png, tushar-portrait.png) are
square crops of the reference images the tara and tushar avatar characters are
built from, and they are the still the launcher wears before the call — nothing
mounts a face to draw a button.

  © 2026 Voqalize Technologies Private Limited. All rights reserved.
  Generated with AI image models.

They are not covered by the licence of the repository around them. They are
included so this demo runs as published; they may not be reused, modified or
redistributed apart from it. The characters themselves are not in this
repository: `@voqalize/avatar` fetches them from avatar.voqalize.com at mount,
under the Voqalize avatar runtime's own licence.
